  "blocks": [
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先确认你看的是否真是21-1029.00汇总类别，而不是某个已单列的社会工作专业方向。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "social-workers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "不要用“社会工作者”头衔猜日常任务；先要到对象、问题、服务、记录、监督和资格。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "social-workers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全练习只审三张虚构岗位卡的7字段：服务对象、主要问题、服务/产出、机构场景、记录/协作、资格/授权、升级安排（触发+对象）。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "social-workers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "A：成年社区居民；住房资源衔接；服务/产出未知；市政项目；只记虚构转介编号并与项目组协作；要求岗位培训且不含临床授权；“服务范围不明则升级项目主管”，缺1。B：退役人员；就业适应；资源导航清单；非营利机构；记录/协作未知；资格/授权未知；“任一记录或资格不明则升级合规负责人”，缺2。C：灾后家庭；临时安置信息；资源清单与转介状态；政府项目；虚构编号且与安置组协作；岗位培训、无临床权限；“出现服务范围争议时升级项目主管”，缺0。只做范围审阅，不接触真实个案。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "social-workers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
