          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 21-1029.00是“All Other”汇总类别，指未被单独列出的社会工作者；O*NET明确该标题无统一职业任务数据。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-umbrella"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "21-1029.00是无统一任务数据的剩余汇总；21-1023.00聚焦精神健康/物质滥用评估治疗，21-1021.00聚焦儿童、家庭和学校社会服务。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-child",
                  "onet-mental",
                  "onet-umbrella"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "“All Other”类别内部差异很大，适配只能在具体岗位的对象、问题、服务、记录、监督和资格明确后再判断。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "由于21-1029.00没有O*NET任务或技术数据，本页不声称特定AI采用率、任务暴露或替代率。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "由于21-1029.00没有O*NET任务或技术数据，本页不声称特定AI采用率、任务暴露或替代率。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "国家统计局2025工资资料按行业和人员大类聚合，不能作为21-1029.00在中国的精确工资。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET/BLS为美国21-1029.00给出的2025工资中位数是71,900美元/年、34.57美元/小时；其他工资分位在本页引用的数据中未提供。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-stats"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 21-1029.00汇总页没有提供统一教育或训练数据；必须回到具体岗位核对。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-umbrella"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "本页不从汇总类别推导个案评估、干预、危机、隐私或授权流程；虚构练习只审岗位说明字段。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET/BLS列出2024年就业81,000、2024—2034增长3%—4%、期间预计空缺7,000。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-stats"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "汇总数据不能替代具体岗位、地区、机构、合同和资格核验。",
                "id": "social-workers.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.social-workers.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
